Test data
---------

Every script, payload, IMEI and value in the tests and the example of this
module is a made-up demo value.

The nested test-only module ttn (ttn/, its own go.mod; nothing imports it
and it is not part of this module) carries device makers' payload codecs
and their examples, unchanged, from TheThingsNetwork/lorawan-devices
(https://github.com/TheThingsNetwork/lorawan-devices, commit
900afb52024f795f073ee4192d845af12d2168d0), under ttn/testdata/lorawan-devices.
That repository declares the Apache License 2.0 (in its package.json; it
has no LICENSE file), with The Things Network Foundation as author; the
codecs and examples are contributed by the respective device makers
(adeunis, Browan, Decentlab, Dragino, Elsys, MClimate, Milesight IoT,
Netvox, SenseCAP, Tektelic, Watteco), and files that carry a maker's own
copyright header keep it. A copy of the licence text is in
ttn/testdata/lorawan-devices/LICENSE; where the files come from is in
ttn/testdata/SOURCE.txt.

The ttn module also uses gopkg.in/yaml.v3 (MIT and Apache-2.0) to read
the codec YAML files.
